      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mooreland%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mooreland sits in a valley at an altitude of 1,900 feet, about five miles north of the North Canadian River.",
